OL,3,GNEWSASark general election polls close
OL,4,
OL,5,FVoting has now finished in the 2026
OL,6,FSark general election.
OL,8,FFour women and 12 men are on the ballot
OL,9,Ffor the vote to fill 10 of the 18 seats
OL,10,Favailable.
OL,12,FNine seats are available for a
OL,13,Ffour-year term and one seat for a
OL,14,Ftwo-year term, after one conseiller was
OL,15,Fdeselected due to non-attendance at
OL,16,Fthree consecutive statutory meetings of
OL,17,Fthe Sark government earlier this year.
OL,19,FThe Island Hall and its grounds housed
OL,20,Fthe polling station for the election
OL,21,Funtil 18:00 GMT, with votes to be
OL,22,Fcounted this evening.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
